        "title": "Alung rianra pukhou alao kumma",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alung rianra pukhou alao kumma ai kap,",
            "Kagan kathui alung taraiRuanna tat bam pukhou;",
            "Neikhat jingbang lumlou khou #-5,",
            "Alung rianramei nthak the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai kao bamni tat tuan kanmeimei puta,",
            "Nang #-5 rammak mei #-5 ata;",
            "Sumlou nimei mak ge,",
            "Guang lou datro kagan kathui,",
            "Alung rianramei sum lou datro.",
            "",
            "2. Akumma lung nicho? Nru-nrit na kum,",
            "Kagan khat khou munpuang kumma",
            "Puang pat dat puni cho?",
            "Kamei bammei ram gaimei tei,",
            "Jiangri patna jao guang lou datro.",
            "",
            "3. Hei kandih hei npat loudumei tingsang the,",
            "Tingkauh Raguang he poubaumei;",
            "Niu pang khou bam tucho?",
            "Kalvari munpuang tuai puinung,",
            "Tattuan kanmei ngalan guang datro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
